<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="HEB" style="id">- Kuturikihwa kwoBhaibheri muchiKorekore</book>
  <para style="h">VaHebheru</para>
  <para style="toc1">Tsamba raPhauro kuvaHebheru</para>
  <para style="toc2">VaHebheru</para>
  <para style="toc3">VaHeb</para>
  <para style="mt2">Tsamba kuVaHebheru</para>
  <para style="mt1">kuvaHebheru</para>
  <para style="imt">Kuwidzira</para>
  <para style="ip">Bhuku rovaHebheru itsamba rinokurudzira rinonangidza kuti Jesu adozazisa tini zviporofiti zvoChibvumirano choKare. Ridonyohwa kunge mharidzo. Mubhuku rovaHebheru muno zvinyohwa zvinopfuura makumi matanhatu zvinonangidza zvinyohwa zvomuChibvumirano choKare zvinonangidza pachenu mazazisiro yadoita Jesu chiporofiti nomabasa yomuphirisita mukuru wochiJudha. Nondava yakarei bhuku ridoitihwa kukurudzira maKhirisitu vochiJudha. Bhuku rovaHebheru rinonangidza kuti Jesu adozazisa tini mutemo kuitira kuti vaphirisita vareke kudzopa kamu zvibairo. Jesu wanga ari chibairo chozvitadzo zvese, kabodzi zvichibva zvagarirafuti zvidodaro. MaKhirisitu yonguwa dzedu vanogona kuwana kurudziro mutsamba rokuvaHebheru kuti varambe vachitevera Jesu Khirisitu saiye anoita kuti zvigoneke nesu kuvimba naMwari, nokuramba tichivimba naye (vaHebheru 12:2).</para>
  <para style="ip">Hapanai anoziva munyori wavaHebheru, asi vadzidzi vadopa pfungwa dzokuti ndinhumwa Phauro, Ruka kana Bhanabhasi. Gore raridonyohwa harizikanewo asi vazinji vanotenda kuti ridonyohwa makore makumi manomwe mumasure mokuzvahwa kwaKhirisitu. Jerusarema ridoparadziwa mugore romakumi manomwe, asi munyori wotsamba rakareri anonyaira pamusoro poJerusarema sekunge ranga risati raparadziwa. Bhuku ravaHebheru ridonyorehwa muguta roRoma (vaHebheru 13:24) futi ridotenderedzewa pakati pomakherekhe yadotikuti.</para>
  <para style="iot">Marongehwo</para>
  <para style="io1">Munyori anonangidza kuti Jesu mukuru kuvaporofiti vaMwari nongirozi (vaHebheru 1:1—4:13).</para>
  <para style="io1">Zvino anodzoenderera mberi achinangidza kuti Jesu mukuru kuvapirisita vanoshumira muimba yaMwari muJerusarema (vaHebheru 4:14—7:28).</para>
  <para style="io1">Pakare ushumiri hwaJesu mbukuru kukunda chibvumirano chidoitiwa naMwari novanhu vache kuburikidza nomutemo waadopasa Mozisi (vaHebheru 8:1—10:31).</para>
  <para style="io1">Mumasure mokutsanangura kuti Jesu mukuru nomitoo yese, munyori anopasa kuraira kunobatika kudoti kuti (vaHebheru 10:32—13:17).</para>
  <para style="io1">Pakupedzisira munyori anopedza tsamba nokurudziro futi nokumoresa (vaHebheru 13:18-25).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="HEB 1" />
  <para style="s">Shoko raMwari kuburikidza noMwanakomana wache</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 1:1" />Kare Mwari adonyaira kumadzibaba yedu nomitoo mizinji uye nonzira dzidowanda kuburikidza novaporofiti, <verse eid="HEB 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 1:2" />asi mumazuva yakareyano yokupedzisira adonyaira kwatiri kuburikidza noMwanakomana wache, waadogadza kuva muji wonhaka yozvinhu zvese, waadosikawo naye zvinhu zvese. <verse eid="HEB 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 1:3" />Ndiye chiratidzo chokubhwinya kwaMwari nochimiro chache chaicho, anochengeta zvisikwa zvese nosimba roshoko rache. Paadopedza kukohorora zvitadzo, adogarikika kujanja roruji roUkuru kudenga.<verse eid="HEB 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukuru hwoMwanakomana waMwari</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 1:4" />Mwanakomana adova mukuru zvidonyanya kupinda ngirozi sezvo zita raadogara nhaka ridonaka kukunda mazita yadzene. <verse eid="HEB 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 1:5" />Nokuti kungirozi ipi Mwari yaadoti kwairi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:5">“Ndiwe Mwanakomana wangu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:5">nasi ndakuzvara?”</para>
  <para style="b" vid="HEB 1:5" />
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 1:5">Kana kuti pakamu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:5">“Ndichava Baba vache,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:5">uye iye achava Mwanakomana wangu?”<verse eid="HEB 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 1:6" />Pakamu, paanouyisa dangwe rache munyika, anoti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:6">“Ngirozi dzese dzaMwari mbadzimunamate.”<verse eid="HEB 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 1:7" />Kungirozi anoti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:7">“Anoita kuti ngirozi dzache dzive mhepo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:7">novaranda vache kuti vave marimi yomoto.”<verse eid="HEB 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 1:8" />Asi pamusoro poMwanakomana anoti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:8">“Mupando wenyu woushe, imi Mwari, uripo nokusingaperepere!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:8">Tsvimbo yokururama ndiyo tsvimbo youshe hwenyu.<verse eid="HEB 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 1:9" />Mudoda kururama mudovenga kusayamutemo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:9">Nokudaro Mwari, iye Mwari wenyu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:9">adokuzodzai nomapfuta yomufaro</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:9">kupinda shamwari dzenyu.”<verse eid="HEB 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 1:10" />Uye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:10">“Imipa, Ishe, mudoteya nheyo dzonyika pakuthanga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:10">uye matenga ibasa romanja yenyu,<verse eid="HEB 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 1:11" />iyo yachaparara, asi imipa mucharamba muripo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:11">iyo yese yachasakara kunge biza.<verse eid="HEB 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 1:12" />Muchayapeta kunge jasi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:12">uye kunge biza yachasanduhwa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:12">Asi imipa munoramba mudodaro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:12">nomakore yenyu hayapere.”<verse eid="HEB 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 1:13" />Adombonyaira kuno ngirozi ipi achiti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:13">“Garikika kujanja rangu rokuruji</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:13">kusvikira ndaita vavengi vako</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:13">chitsiko chotsoka dzako?”<verse eid="HEB 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 1:14" />Ko ngirozi dzese mweyaba nai inoshumira idotumiwa kuti ishumire, avo vachagara nhaka yoruponiso?<verse eid="HEB 1:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="HEB 2" />
  <para style="s">Ruponiso Rukuru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 2:1" />Nokudaro tinofanira kutetekeretsa kuno zvakarezvo zvatidonzva, kuti tireke kubirika kubva pazviri. <verse eid="HEB 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 2:2" />Nokuti kana mashoko yadonyairiwa nongirozi yanga yanosimba uye kutadza kwese nokusatetekera kwese kudopasiwa mubairo udofanira, <verse eid="HEB 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 2:3" />tichapukunyuka tiniko kana tisinai basa nokuponesewa kukuru kudodai? Kudoparidziwa pakuthanga naIshe, kukasimbisiwa kwatiri novakarevo vadomunzva. <verse eid="HEB 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 2:4" />Naiyewo Mwari adopupura nozviratidzo nozvishamiso nominana mizinji uye nozvipo zvoMweya Mutsvene zvidokovehwa nokuda kwache.<verse eid="HEB 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Anotitungamira Kuruponiso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 2:5" />Nokuti Mwari haanai kuisa pasi pongirozi nyika inouya yatiri kunyaira nozvayo. <verse eid="HEB 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 2:6" />Asi zvidopupuriwa noumwe panoimwe nzvimbo achiti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 2:6">“Ko munhu chiiko zvamunomuitira hanya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 2:6">kana mwanakomana womunhu zvamunomubvakachira?<verse eid="HEB 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 2:7" />Kwokanguwa mudomuderedza pashoma panongirozi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 2:7">mudomushongedza korona yokubhwinya nokukudziwa,<verse eid="HEB 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 2:8" />mudoisa zvinhu zvese pasi potsoka dzache.”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 2:8">Zvino pakuisa zvinhu zvese pasi pache, haanai kusiya chinhu kunze chisinai kuisiwa pasi pache. Panguwa ino hatinati taona zvinhu zvese zviri pasi pache. <verse eid="HEB 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 2:9" />Asi tinoona Jesu, iye kwokanguwa kapfupi adoitiwa mudiki pashoma kungirozi, asi zvino adoshongedzewa korona yokubhwinya nokukudziwa nondava yokuti adotambudzika pakupfa, kuitira kuti nomutsa waMwari aravire ipfa nokuda kwomunhu wese. <verse eid="HEB 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 2:10" />Nokuti zvanga zvidokodzera kuti zvinhu zvese zvidoitihwa iye uye kuti zvinhu zvese zviripo nokuda kwache, pakuuyisa kwache vanakomana vadowanda pakubhwinya, akwanise kuva muvambi woruponiso ravo rudokwana kuburikidza nokutambudzika.<verse eid="HEB 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 2:11" />Nokuti uyo anovaita vatsvene novakarevo vanoitiwa vatsvene vese mbabodzi. Ndosaka asinganyare kuvadaidza kuti hama. <verse eid="HEB 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 2:12" />Iye anoti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 2:12">“Ndichaparidzira zita renyu kuhama dzangu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 2:12">pakati poungano ndichakurumbidzai.”<verse eid="HEB 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 2:13" />Pakare, “Ndichaisa kuvimba kwangu maari.” Uye, “Pano ndini, novana vandidopasiwa naMwari.”<verse eid="HEB 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 2:14" />Nokudaro vana zvavari vonyama nogazi, naiyewo pachake adotorawo zvibodzibodzizvo, kuti kuburikidza noipfa aparadze anosimba roipfa, iye, jabhurosi, <verse eid="HEB 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 2:15" />wosunungura ivo vese vadoitiwa varanda kwoupenyu hwese kuburikidza nokucha ipfa. <verse eid="HEB 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 2:16" />Nokuti pachokwadi haabatsiri ngirozi asi vana vaAbhurahamu. <verse eid="HEB 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 2:17" />Naizvozvo adofanira kuti afanane nohama dzache pazvese, kuitira kuti ave muphirisita mukuru adotendeka uye anomutsa mubasa raMwari, kuti adzikinure zvitema zvovanhu. <verse eid="HEB 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 2:18" />Nokuti iye pachake adotambudzika paadoyedzewa, anogona kubatsira vanoyedzewa.<verse eid="HEB 2:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="HEB 3" />
  <para style="s">Jesu Mukuru kuna Mozisi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 3:1" />Naizvozvo, hama dzitsvene, vanokovana kudaidziwa kwokudenga, fungitsitsai Jesu nhumwa nomuphirisita mukuru watinopupura. <verse eid="HEB 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 3:2" />Wanga adotendeka kuno uyo adomugadza, sekutendekawo kudoita Mozisi muimba yaMwari. <verse eid="HEB 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 3:3" />Nokuti Jesu anofanira kukudziwa kupinda Mozisi, sekukudziwa kunoitiwa muvakhi woimba kupinda imba yacho. <verse eid="HEB 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 3:4" />Nokuti imba imwe noimwe inovakhiwa nomunhu, asi muvakhi wozvinhu zvese ndiMwari. <verse eid="HEB 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 3:5" />Zvino Mozisi wanga adotendeka muimba yaMwari semuranda, kuti ave chapupu chozvinhu zvaidzonyairiwa pamasure. <verse eid="HEB 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 3:6" />Asi Khirisitu wanga adotendeka pamusoro poimba yaMwari seMwanakomana. Uye tiri imba yache kana tikabatitsitsa kuvimba kwedu nokuzvirumbidza mutariro yedu.<verse eid="HEB 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Zororo roVana vaMwari</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 3:7" />Naizvozvo, sezvinonyaira Mweya Mutsvene achiti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 3:7">“Nasi kana muchinzva izvi rache,<verse eid="HEB 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 3:8" />rekai kuomesa mwoyo yenyu sepanguwa yokupanduka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:8">pazuva rokuyedzewa musango,<verse eid="HEB 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 3:9" />pandidoyedzewa nomadzibaba venyu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:9">vadoona mabasa yangu kwomakore makumi manai.<verse eid="HEB 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 3:10" />Naizvozvo ndidokaripisiwa norudzi rakarero, ndikati,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:10">‘Vanogara vachimbondotaika mumwoyo yavo, havanai kuziva nzira dzangu.’<verse eid="HEB 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 3:11" />Ndidopika muukari hwangu, ndikati,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:11">‘Havachapinda pazororo rangu!’”<verse eid="HEB 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 3:12" />Chenjerai, hama dzangu, kuti mukati moumwe wenyu mureke kuva nomwoyo udoipa usingatende, mutsauke muchibirika kubva kuna Mwari mupenyu. <verse eid="HEB 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 3:13" />Asi simbisanai zuva rimwe norimwe, kana kuchiri kunzi “Nasi,” kuti kureke kuva noumwe wenyu anoomesewa mwoyo nokunyengera kwochitema. <verse eid="HEB 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 3:14" />Nokuti tinokovana muna Khirisitu, kana tichibatitsitsa mavambo yokutenda kwedu kusvikira pakupedzisira.<verse eid="HEB 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 3:15" />Pazvinonyaihwa zvichinzi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 3:15">“Nasi, kana muchinzva izvi rache,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:15">rekai kuomesa mwoyo yenyu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:15">sepanguwa dzokupanduka.”<verse eid="HEB 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 3:16" />Mbanaani vadonzva uye vadomupandukira? Vanga vasiri ivo vese vadobirika muIjipiti pasi poutungamiriri hwaMozisi chere? <verse eid="HEB 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 3:17" />Mbanani vadomukaripisa kwomakore makumi manai? Vanga vasiri ivo chere anyakutadza, vano mitumbi idowira musango? <verse eid="HEB 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 3:18" />Anga adopika kunaani achiti havapinde pazororo rangu, ndivoba vokutadza kuteerera? <verse eid="HEB 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 3:19" />Saka tinoona kuti vanga vasingakwanise kupinda nokuda kwokusatenda kwavo.<verse eid="HEB 3:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="HEB 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 4:1" />Naizvozvo, chipikihwa chokupinda muzororo rache zvachichiripo, tinofanira kuchira kuti pangave noumwe wenyu achawaniwa wakundikana kusvika ikoko. <verse eid="HEB 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 4:2" />Nokuti nyaya idonaka idouya kwatiri sezvaidoitawo kwavari, asi shoko ravadonzva harinai kuvabatsira, nokuti harinai kusanganisiwa nokutenda kwaivo vadonzva. <verse eid="HEB 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 4:3" />Nokuti isisu vadotenda tinopinda pazororo rakarero, sezvaadonyaira achiti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 4:3">“Sezvandidopika pakukaripa kwangu ndichiti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 4:3">‘Musevedzi vanopindaba pazororo rangu.’”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 4:3">Kunyange mabasa yache yanga yakwanisiwa kubva pakuvamba kwonyika. <verse eid="HEB 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 4:4" />Nokuti adonyaira panoimwe nzvimbo nozvozuva rochinomwe nonzira yakarei, achiti, “Mwari adozorora pazuva rochinomwe kubva pamabasa yache yese.” <verse eid="HEB 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 4:5" />Pakamu panzvimbo yakarei adoti, “Vanopindaba muzororo rangu.” <verse eid="HEB 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 4:6" />Kunyange zvazvene shoko richiripo rokuti vamwe vapinde, uye kuti vakarevo vadothanga kuritambira vadotadza kupinda nondava yokusaya kuteerera, <verse eid="HEB 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 4:7" />pakare anotara rimwe zuva, raanoti “Nasi,” achiti kuburikidza naDhavhiti munguwa irefu idopfuura, mumazvi yadonyaihwa kare, yokuti</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 4:7">“Nasi, kana muchinzva izvi rache,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 4:7">rekai kuomesa mwoyo yenyu.”<verse eid="HEB 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 4:8" />Nokuti dai Joshuwa adovapasa zororo, Mwari vaidzonyairaba pamusoro porimwe zuva pamasure. <verse eid="HEB 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 4:9" />Nokudaro, zororo roSabata rovanhu vaMwari richiripo. <verse eid="HEB 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 4:10" />Nokuti ani naani anopinda pazororo raMwari anoreka mabasa yache sezvidoita Mwari pamabasa yache. <verse eid="HEB 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 4:11" />Naizvozvo mbatisimbirirei kuti tipinde muzororo rakarero, kuti kureke kuva nomunhu anowa nonzira ibodziyo yokusaya kuteerera kunge ivo.<verse eid="HEB 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 4:12" />Nokuti shoko raMwari ripenyu futi rinoshanda, ridopinza kukunda bakatwa rinocheka nonhivi dzese, rinojunga kusvika panopararana mwoyo nomweya, nomapfundo nomwongo, uye rinotonga ndangariro nozvido zvomwoyo. <verse eid="HEB 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 4:13" />Nopamberi pache hapanai chisikwa chidosvisvika, asi zvinhu zvese zviri pachenu futi zvidozaruka pameso yaiye watinofanira kuzvidairira kwaari.<verse eid="HEB 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Muphirisita Mukuru Panovese</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 4:14" />Nokudaro, zvatinomuphirisita mukuru panovese anomukurumbira adokwira kudenga, Jesu Mwanakomana waMwari, mbatibatitsitsei kutenda kwatinopfakaza. <verse eid="HEB 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 4:15" />Nokuti hatinai muphirisita mukuru panovese asingagone kutinzvira mutsa pakuvhuwa kwedu, asi uyo adoedzewa pazvinhu zvese kunge isisu, asinai zvitema. <verse eid="HEB 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 4:16" />Naizvozvo mbatinyedzei tisingache kumupando youshe wonyasha, kuti tinzvihwe tsitsi nokuwana mutsa tibatsihwe panguwa idokodzera.<verse eid="HEB 4:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="HEB 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 5:1" />Nokuti muphirisita mukuru wese anosarudziwa kubva kuvanhu anogadziwa kuti amiririre vanhu pazvinhu zvaMwari, kuti apereke zvipo nozvibairo pamusoro pozvitema. <verse eid="HEB 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 5:2" />Iye anogona kubata zvidopfava vasingazive novanotaika, sezvo iye pachake adovhuwawo. <verse eid="HEB 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 5:3" />Nondava yozvakarezvi iye anofanira kuzvibaira chibairo pamusoro pozvitema zvache, sezvaanobaira zvovanhu. <verse eid="HEB 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 5:4" />Futi hapanai munhu angazvitorere kuremekedzewa ikoku, asi anotodaidziwa naMwari, sezvidoitiwa Aroni.<verse eid="HEB 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 5:5" />Saizvozvowo Khirisitu haanai kuzvitutumadza pachake pakuitiwa muphirisita mukuru, asi adogadziwa naiye adoti kwaari,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 5:5">“Ndiwe Mwanakomana wangu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 5:5">nasi ndakubereka,”<verse eid="HEB 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 5:6" />sezvaanonyaira kamu panoimwe nzvimbo achiti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 5:6">“Ndiwe muphirisita nokusingapere,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 5:6">unoupirisita hunobva panaMerikizedheki.”<verse eid="HEB 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 5:7" />Mumazuva yokurarama kwache panyama, Jesu adouya kunaiye wanga achigona kumuhwira paipfa, nominyengetero nozvikumbiro, achirira nokurira kukuru nomisodzi, ipopo adonzviwa nokuda kwokucha kwache Mwari. <verse eid="HEB 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 5:8" />Kunyange zvazvene waiva Mwanakomana, adodzidza kuteerera kuburikidza nozvaadotambudzika nazvo, <verse eid="HEB 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 5:9" />uye adoti wakwanisiwa adodzova muvambi wokuponesewa kusingapere kuno vese vanomutetekera, <verse eid="HEB 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 5:10" />adonzi naMwari muphirisita mukuru anoupirisita hunobva panaMerikizedheki.<verse eid="HEB 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chenjedzo Pamusoro Pokusiya Kutenda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 5:11" />Pamusoro pozvakarezvi tinozvidowanda zvokunyaira zvidooma kutsanangura, zvamava maburunzeve pakunzva. <verse eid="HEB 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 5:12" />Nokuti kunyange maifanira kuva vadzidzisi zvino, kana tichinangara nguwa, munoda munhu anokudzidzisai pakare dzidziso dzokuthanga dzoshoko raMwari. Munoda kupasiwa mukaka aikona zvokuja zvikukutu, <verse eid="HEB 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 5:13" />nokuti wese anorarama nomukaka haanai useza pashoko rokururama, nokuti achiri mucheche. <verse eid="HEB 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 5:14" />Asi zvokuja zvikukutu nzvovakura, vanokuziva kudodzidzisiwa nonzira yokurovedzehwa kuzivitsitsa zvidonaka nozvidoipa.<verse eid="HEB 5:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="HEB 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 6:1" />Naizvozvo mbatisiyei dzidziso yozvokuthanga kwaKhirisitu, tipfuurire pamberi nokukura, tisingaise kamu nheyo yokupinduka pamabasa yadopfa noyokutenda kunaMwari, <verse eid="HEB 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 6:2" />nodzidziso yotsika yokushambidzana, yokubatiwa pamusoro, kumuka kwovadopfa, uye nokutongewa kusingapere. <verse eid="HEB 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 6:3" />Zvakarezvi tichazviita kana Mwari achitendera.<verse eid="HEB 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 6:4" />Nokuti zvinokonekaba kudzotsera pakamu vadovhenekehwa kare, vadoravidza chipo chokudenga uye vadogovehwawo Mweya Mutsvene, <verse eid="HEB 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 6:5" />uye vadoravidza kunaka kwoshoko raMwari nomasimba yonguwa inouya, <verse eid="HEB 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 6:6" />kana vakadzotsauka zvinokonekaba kuvasandura pakamu kuti vapinduke nokuti vanoroverera pakare Mwanakomana waMwari nokumunyadzisa pachenu. <verse eid="HEB 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 6:7" />Nokuti nyika inomwa mvura inombondona pairi, inounzira miriwo inobatsira vaye vanorimihwa inoropafadziwa naMwari. <verse eid="HEB 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 6:8" />Asi kana ikabereka minzva nochaguduma, inobatsiraba chinhu iri papfupi nokushurikidziwa mugumo wayene nghupisiwa.<verse eid="HEB 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 6:9" />Asi imipa hama kunyange tichinyaira zvidodaizvi, tinoziva chaizvo pamusoro penyu zvinhu zvidonakitsa zvinoisa kuruponeso. <verse eid="HEB 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 6:10" />Nokuti Mwari haasi uye asinai kururama kuti angakangamwe basa renyu norudo ramudoratidza mukushumira vatsvene nokuda kwache nanasi muchiri kuvashumira. <verse eid="HEB 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 6:11" />Uye tinoda kuti umwe noumwe wenyu asimbirire kunangidza kushingaira kubodzibodziko kusvika kumagumo kuitira kuti zvamunotarisira mugone kuva nazvo zvidokwana. <verse eid="HEB 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 6:12" />Kuitira kuti mureke kuva nonungo, asi kuti muve vateveri voavo vadogara nhaka yozvivimbiso nonzira yokutenda nokutsungirira.<verse eid="HEB 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chokwadi choChivimbiso zvaMwari</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 6:13" />Nokuti Mwari paadoita chivimbiso kunaAbhurahamu, nondava yokuti panga pasinai umwe mukuru waaidzopika naye, adopika naiye pachake, <verse eid="HEB 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 6:14" />achiti, “Chokwadi ndichakukomborera uye ndichakuwanza.” <verse eid="HEB 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 6:15" />Nokudaro mumasure mokutsungirira, Abhurahamu adowana chivimbiso. <verse eid="HEB 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 6:16" />Chokwadi nyhokuti vanhu vanopika nomukuru kwavari, uye nharo dzavo dzese dzinopedzewa nomhiko. <verse eid="HEB 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 6:17" />Nokudaro Mwari adoti achida chaizvo kunangidza kuvaji vonhaka yochivimbiso kuti chinangwa chache chinosandukaba adochisimbisa nomhiko, <verse eid="HEB 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 6:18" />kuitira kuti kuburikidza nozvinhu zviiri zvisingasanduke, nokuti hazvigoneke kuti Mwari abhwodoke, kuti isisu tidotizira kutariro idoisiwa pamberi pedu kuti tiibate tive nokurudziro idosimba. <verse eid="HEB 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 6:19" />Tinayo tariro yakarei idotsigihwa nochitsigiso chisingagwetedzeke chomweya, inopinda mukati munzvimbo itsvene, kuseri kwobiza rinovharidzira zviri kumberi, <verse eid="HEB 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 6:20" />ndiko Jesu kwaadotithangira kupinda ari mumiririri wedu, adova muphirisita mukuru panovese nokusingapere anoupirisita hudofanana nohwaMerikizedheki.<verse eid="HEB 6:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="HEB 7" />
  <para style="s">Muphirisita Merikizedheki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 7:1" />Nokuti iyeyu Merikizedheki, mambo wokuSaremi, muphirisita waMwari Wokumusorosoro, adosangana naAbhurahamu paanga achibva kobaya madzimambo uye adomukomborera, <verse eid="HEB 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 7:2" />ipopo Abhurahamu adomupasa chogumi chozvinhu zvese. Pakuthanga zita rache iye, rinodudzihwa kuti, mambo wokururama, uye pakamu mambo woSaremi, ndokuti, mambo worugare. <verse eid="HEB 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 7:3" />Haanai baba kana amai kana madziteteguru, haanai kuthanga kwomazuva kana magumo youpenyu, asi adofananidziwa noMwanakomana waMwari anogara ari muphirisita nokusingapere. <verse eid="HEB 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 7:4" />Zvino nangarai kukura kwowakareyo. Abhurahamu teteguru wedu adotomupasa chogumi chozvaadopamba. <verse eid="HEB 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 7:5" />Uye avo vari vanakomana vaRevhi vanopasiwa basa rouphirisita vanomutemo uri mumurairo wokuti vatore chogumi kubva kuvanhu, iko kuhama dzavo, kunyange vakareva pakamu vari vana vaAbhurahamu. <verse eid="HEB 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 7:6" />Asi murume wakareyu wanga asinai nhoroondo yorudzi naRevhi adotambira zvogumi kubva kunaAbhurahamu ndokukomborera iye wanga anozvivimbiso. <verse eid="HEB 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 7:7" />Zvino hazvirambike kuti mudiki ndiye anokomborehwa nomukuru. <verse eid="HEB 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 7:8" />Pano zvogumi zviri kutambihwa novanhu vanopfa, asi kunorimwe divi zvinotambihwa nouyo anopupurihwa kuti mupenyu. <verse eid="HEB 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 7:9" />Umwe angatiwo Revhi pachake adotambira zvogumi, iye adobhadhara zvogumi kuburikidza naAbhurahamu, <verse eid="HEB 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 7:10" />nokuti wanga achiri muchiuno chababa vache Abhurahamu paadosangana naMerikizedheki. <verse eid="HEB 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 7:11" />Zvino kana kukwana kuchiuyisiwa nonzira youphirisita hwonzvahwa dzaRevhi nokuti pasi pahwene vanhu vadopasiwa murairo, ko umwe muphirisita waidzomukirei anorudzi naMerikizedheki asingaitiwe anorudzi naAroni? <verse eid="HEB 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 7:12" />Nokuti kana upirisita huchisanduhwa, nomurairo unofanira kuti usanduriwewo pakamu. <verse eid="HEB 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 7:13" />Nokuti uyo anorehwa pamusoro pozvinhu zvakarezvi wanga ari worimwe rudzi, ranga risinai munhu adombobata basa paatari. <verse eid="HEB 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 7:14" />Nokuti zviri pachenu kuti Ishe wedu adobva kuna Judha, uye pamusoro porudzi rakareri Mozisi haanai kunyaira zvovapirisita.<verse eid="HEB 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Umwe Muphirisita Adofanana naMerikizedheki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 7:15" />Zvakarezvi zvidonyanya kuva pachenu zvokuvapo kwoumwe muphirisita adofanana naMerikizedheki, <verse eid="HEB 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 7:16" />uyo asinai kuitiwa muphirisita nokuda kwomutemo unobva padzinza raadozvahwa panyama asi nosimba roupenyu husingaparadzike. <verse eid="HEB 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 7:17" />Nokuti iye anopupurihwa zvichinzi, “Iwepa ndiwe muphirisita nokusingapere, upirisita hwako hunobva panaMerikizedheki.” <verse eid="HEB 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 7:18" />Pano rimwe divi, murairo wokare udosendekewa padivi nokuda kwokuvhuwa kwawene. <verse eid="HEB 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 7:19" />Nokuti murairo haunai kuita kuti chinhu chive chidokwana, asi kuno rimwewo divi, kuri kuisiwa tariro iri nani kuti tinyedze kuna Mwari kuburikidza nayo. <verse eid="HEB 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 7:20" />Futi yanga inomhiko. Nokuti vamwe vadova vaphirisita pasinai mhiko, <verse eid="HEB 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 7:21" />asi iyeyu adopupurihwa nomhiko, Mwari paadoti kwaari,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 7:21">“Ishe watopika</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 7:21">uye haasandure pfungwa dzache,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 7:21">‘Uri muphirisita nokusingapere.’”<verse eid="HEB 7:21" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 7:22" />Zvakarezvi zvidoita kuti Jesu ave chibatiso chochibvumirano chidonakitsa.<verse eid="HEB 7:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 7:23" />Vaphirisita vokare vanga vari vazinji pauwandu, nokuti vanga vachitadzisiwa noipfa kuramba vari pabasa, <verse eid="HEB 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 7:24" />asi nokuti Jesu anorarama nokusingapere, anouphirisita husingapfuruke. <verse eid="HEB 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 7:25" />Nokudaro anogona kuponesa nguwa dzese vaye vanonyedza kuna Mwari kuburikidza naiye, nokuti anorarama nguwa dzese kuti avanyengeterere.<verse eid="HEB 7:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 7:26" />Nokuti zvanga zvidokodzera kuti tive nomuphirisita mukuru adodai, mutsvene, asinai chaanonenedzehwa, asinai padosvipisiwa, adoparadzanisiwa novatadzi, adokwidziwa kumusoro kumatenga. <verse eid="HEB 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 7:27" />Hazvinai kuita kunge vamwe vaphirisita vakuru, iye haapire zvipiriso zuva rimwe norimwe saivo, kuthanga nokuda kwozvitema zvache iye pasure wodzopira zvozvitema zvovanhu. Iye adobaira zvitema zvavo kabodzi zvikapera paadozvipa pachake. <verse eid="HEB 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 7:28" />Nokuti murairo unogadza vanhu vadovhuwa kuti vave vaphirisita vakuru, asi shoko rokupika ridodzouya pamasure pomurairo, rinogadza Mwanakomana adokwanisiwa nokusingapere.<verse eid="HEB 7:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="HEB 8" />
  <para style="s">Jesu Muphirisita Wedu Mukuru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 8:1" />Zvino zvatiri kunyaira chaizvo panozvakarezvi nzvizvi, tinomupirisita Mukuru, iye adogarikika kujanja roruji roMupando woUkuru kudenga. <verse eid="HEB 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 8:2" />Ndiye mushumiri woimba itsvene, nowoimba yaMwari yochokwadi isinai kuisiwa nomunhu asi naMwari.<verse eid="HEB 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 8:3" />Nokuti muphirisita mukuru umwe noumwe adogadziwa kuti apereke kuna Mwari zvipo nozvibairo, nokudaro zvidokodzera kuti muphirisita iyeyuwo awane chokupereka. <verse eid="HEB 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 8:4" />Zvino dai wanga ari panyika, anga dai asinai kuva muphirisita zvachose, nokuda kwokuti vaphirisita varipo vanopa zvipo sezvinorehwa nomurairo. <verse eid="HEB 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 8:5" />Ivo vanoshumira mufananidzo nomumvurimvuri woimba yaMwari yokudenga, nokuti Mozisi paanga wakuda kuita imba yaMwari, adokohomedzewa naMwari, achiti, “Ona kuti wanhadzira zvese maererano nonzira yozvaudonangidziwa mugomo.” <verse eid="HEB 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 8:6" />Asi sezvazviri, Khirisitu adowana ushumiri hudonyanyitsa kunaka kukunda hwokare nokuti sungano yaanoreverera idonaka idosimbisiwa nozvivimbiso zvidonakitsa.<verse eid="HEB 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 8:7" />Nokuti kana dai chibvumirano chokuthanga changa chisinai chachinonenedzehwa, panga dai pasinai nzvimbo yochibvumirano chochipiri. <verse eid="HEB 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 8:8" />Nokuti anowana mhosva kwavari paanoti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:8">“Mazuva yachauya, ndizvo zvinonyaira Ishe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:8">pandichaita chibvumirano chitsva noimba yaIzirairi uye noimba yaJudha,<verse eid="HEB 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 8:9" />chisinai kufanana nochibvumirano chandidoita nomadzibaba vavo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:9">pazuva randidovabata nojanja ndichivabiritsa munyika yoIjipiti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:9">nokuti havanai kuramba vari muchibvumirano changu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:9">naizvozvo inini handinaiwo kuita hanya navo, ndizvo zvinonyaira Ishe.<verse eid="HEB 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 8:10" />Ichi, ndicho chibvumirano chandichaita noimba yaIzirairi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:10">mumasure momazuva yakareyo, ndizvo zvinonyaira Ishe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:10">Ndichaisa mirairo yangu mupfungwa dzavo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:10">nokuinyora mumwoyo yavo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:10">uye ndichava Mwari wavo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:10">ivo vachava vanhu vangu.<verse eid="HEB 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 8:11" />Hapanai achadzidzisa mabiyache</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:11">kana hama yache achiti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:11">‘Ziva Ishe,’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:11">nokuti vese vachandiziva,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:11">kubva kumudiki kusvikira kumukuru.<verse eid="HEB 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 8:12" />Nokuti ndichava nomutsa nokuda kwounyangadzi hwavo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:12">uye handichadzorangarira zvitema zvavo.”<verse eid="HEB 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 8:13" />Mukunyaira pamusoro poChibvumirano Chitsva anobata Chibvumirano Chokare sechidosakara. Uye chinhu chaakusakara nokuchembera chaakunyangarika.<verse eid="HEB 8:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="HEB 9" />
  <para style="s">Kushumira kwoKudenga nokwoPanyika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 9:1" />Zvino naiyoiwo sungano yokuthanga yanga inomirairo yokushumira nayo uye noimba itsvene yopanyika. <verse eid="HEB 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 9:2" />Nokuti dumba rokukumanira ridomisiwa, mukamuri yarene yokuthanga manga munochigadziko chomwenje, notafura yanga inomazingwa yayene yadokumikidziwa, kamuri yakarei ndiyo yaidaidziwa kuti Nzvimbo Itsvene. <verse eid="HEB 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 9:3" />Zvino pamasure pobiza rochipiri panga pano kamuri yochipiri inoitiwa Itsvene-tsvene, <verse eid="HEB 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 9:4" />manga munombiya yondarama yozvinonushira uye nophutumende yochibvumirano yanga idonamiwa nondarama kumativi yese, makaremo manga muno hari yondarama yanga inomana, notsvimbo yaAroni idothungira, nohwendefa yochibvumirano, <verse eid="HEB 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 9:5" />pamusoro pophutumende panga pano makherubhi yokubhwinya yanga yadofukidza mupando wonyasha. Pano zvakarezvi tinonyairaba zvidowanda parizvino.<verse eid="HEB 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 9:6" />Gadziriro dzakaredzi dzidoti dzaitiwa saizvozvo, vaphirisita vaipinda nguwa nonguwa mukamuri yokuthanga, vachibata mabasa yavo yokushumira, <verse eid="HEB 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 9:7" />asi mukamuri yochipiri muphirisita mukuru ndiye basi waipinda kabodzi pagore, nogazi raanga achizvibaira iye pachake uye norozvitadzo zvovanhu zvavaitadza vasingazive. <verse eid="HEB 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 9:8" />Nozvakarezvi Mweya Mutsvene wainangidza kuti nzira inoenda kuNzvimbo Itsvenetsvene yanga isati yavhuriwa kana dumba rokusangana richiri kushanda. <verse eid="HEB 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 9:9" />Wakareyu waiva mufananidzo wonguwa yakareino. Maererano nourongwa hwakarehu, zvipo nozvipiriso zvinobaihwa zvisingagone kuita kuti hana yaiye mushumiri ichene, <verse eid="HEB 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 9:10" />zvinondova zvokuja nozvokumwa chete, pabodzi nokushamba kudowanda, iri mirairo idoraihwa pamusoro pomuviri kusvikira panguwa yokuvandudziwa.<verse eid="HEB 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 9:11" />Asi Khirisitu paadoratidziwa semupirisita mukuru wozvinhu zvidonaka zvidodzouya, pakarepo kuburikidza nodumba rokusangana rikuru uye idokwana isinai kuitiwa nomanja yomunhu, ndokuti isiri yokusikiwa kuno. <verse eid="HEB 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 9:12" />Adopinda kabodzi zvikapera adomirira vese muNzvimbo Itsvene asinai gazi rombudzi kana rotumhuru asi nogazi rache chairo, ndokutiwanira rudzikinuro risingapere. <verse eid="HEB 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 9:13" />Nokuti kusasiwa kwogazi rombudzi norongunzi norota rotsiru pamusoro povanhu vanotsambwa zvinovaita kuti vanatsiwe nokuchenesewa panyama. <verse eid="HEB 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 9:14" />Ko gazi raKhirisitu adozviita chibairo kunaMwari chisinai zvachinonenedzehwa, chichiitiwa kuburikidza noMweya usingapere, richanyanyitsa tini kunatsa hana dzedu pamabasa yadopfa kuti tishumire Mwari mupenyu!<verse eid="HEB 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 9:15" />Nochikonzero chakarechi Khirisitu ndiye murevereri wochibvumirano chitsva, kuitira kuti avo vadodaidziwa vapasiwe chipikihwa chonhaka yokusingapere. Zvino iye adopfa sechibairo chokuvasunungura kubva kuzvitema zvidotadziwa pasi pochibvumirano chokuthanga. <verse eid="HEB 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 9:16" />Nokuti pano chibvumirano panofanirawo kuva noipfa yowakareyo adoita chibvumiranocho. <verse eid="HEB 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 9:17" />Nokuti chibvumirano chinothanga kushanda chete kana paita ipfa yoadochiita, nokuti hachinai masimba kana adochiita achiri mupenyu. <verse eid="HEB 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 9:18" />Nokudaro kana chibvumirano chokuthanga hachinai kuitiwa pasinai gazi. <verse eid="HEB 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 9:19" />Nokuti Mozisi paadopedza kunyaira kuvanhu vese maererano nomutemo, adotora gazi rotumhuru norombudzi, pabodzi nomvura noukuse hutsvuku notumathai tokamuti kanonzi hisopi ndokuwazira bhuku pacharo novanhu vese, <verse eid="HEB 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 9:20" />achiti, “Rakareri ndiro gazi rochibvumirano chamudoraihwa naMwari kuti muchengete.” <verse eid="HEB 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 9:21" />Uye nonzira ibodzibodziyo adowazira gazi paimba yokusangana nopamidziyo yese yokushumira nayo. <verse eid="HEB 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 9:22" />Zvochokwadi, pasi pomutemo zvinhu zvinenge zvese zvinochenesewa nogazi, uye pasinai kudeuka kwogazi hapanai kurekerehwa kwozvitema.<verse eid="HEB 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chibairo chaKhirisitu Chinobisa Zvitema</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 9:23" />Nokudaro zvanga zvidokodzera kuti mifananidzo yozvinhu zvokudenga ichenesewe nozvibairo zvakarezvi, asi zvinhu zvokudenga pachazvo zvinoda kuchenesewa nozvidonaka kupinda zvakarezvi. <verse eid="HEB 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 9:24" />Nokuti Khirisitu adopindaba muimba itsvene idoitiwa nomanja yovanhu, unova mufananidzo wochaiyo, asi adopinda kudenga chaiko, kuti zvino azviise pamberi paMwari adotimiririra. <verse eid="HEB 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 9:25" />Asingazviite chibairo achidzokerera, kunge muphirisita mukuru anombondopinda paNzvimbo Itsvene gore nogore anogazi risiri rache, <verse eid="HEB 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 9:26" />nokuti dai zvanga zvidodaipo waitambura kadowanda kubva pakuthanga kwonyika. Asi sezvazviri, adooneka kabodzi pakupedzisira kwonguwa kuti abiritse zvitema nokuzviita chibairo kwache. <verse eid="HEB 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 9:27" />Uye zvakudotariwa kuti vanhu vapfe kabodzi, mumasure mozvakarezvo kutongewa kuchidzouya, <verse eid="HEB 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 9:28" />nokudarowo Khirisitu, zvaadoitiwa chibairo kabodzi kuti atakure zvitema zvovadowanda, achadzooneka kwochipiri, aikona kudzotakura zvitema asi kudzoponesa vakarevo vari kumirira noshungu kudzoka kwache.<verse eid="HEB 9:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="HEB 10" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 10:1" />Nokuti mutemo zvauri mumvuri wozvinhu zvidonaka zvichauya usiri mufananidzo chaiwo wozvinhu zvakarezvi, haupfe wakwanisa kuita kuti vanonyedza papfupi vave vadokwanisiwa nozvibairo zvakarezvo zvavanobaira gore nogore. <verse eid="HEB 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 10:2" />Manje kana zvanga zvidodaro, dai zvisinai kupera kubaihwa nai, kana vanonamata vanga vadonatsiwa kabodzi zvichipera vangadai vasinai chere kudzonzva mhosva yozvitema zvavo? <verse eid="HEB 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 10:3" />Asi muzvibairo zvakarezvo munoyeuchidzo yozvitema gore nogore. <verse eid="HEB 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 10:4" />Nokuti gazi rongunzi norombudzi rinokonaba kubiritsa zvitema.<verse eid="HEB 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 10:5" />Saka Khirisitu paadosvika panyika, adoti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:5">“Zvibairo nozvipo mudozvidaba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:5">asi mudondigadzirira muviri,<verse eid="HEB 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 10:6" />hamunai kufarira zvibairo zvinopisiwa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:6">nozvibairo zvinobiritsa zvitema.<verse eid="HEB 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 10:7" />Pakarepo ndidoti, ‘Nangarai, ndauya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:7">kudzoita kuda kwenyu, Imimi Mwari,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:7">sekunyorewa kwazvidoitiwa pamusoro pangu mubhuku romutemo.’”<verse eid="HEB 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 10:8" />Sezvaanonyaira achiti, “Hamunai kuda kana kufarira zvibairo nozvipo uye nozvibairo zvinopisiwa nozvibairo zvozvitema” zvakarezvi zvinobaihwa maererano nomutemo, <verse eid="HEB 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 10:9" />ipopo adowedzera achiti, “Nangarai, ndauya kudzoita kuda kwenyu.” Anobiritsa chokuthanga kuitira kuti aise chochipiri. <verse eid="HEB 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 10:10" />Uye nokuda kwakareku tidoitiwa vatsvene kuburikidza nochibairo chomuviri waJesu Khirisitu udobaihwa kabodzi zvikapera.<verse eid="HEB 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 10:11" />Uye muphirisita umwe noumwe anomira zuva rimwe norimwe achishumira, nokubaira zvibairo zvibodzi bodzizvo kadowanda, zvisingakone kubiritsa zvitema. <verse eid="HEB 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 10:12" />Asi Khirisitu paadobaira chibairo chibodzi chonguwa dzese pamusoro pozvitema, adogarikika pasi kujanja rokuruji raMwari, <verse eid="HEB 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 10:13" />kuti amirire kusvikira vavengi vache vaitiwa chitsiko chotsoka dzache. <verse eid="HEB 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 10:14" />Nokuti nochibairo chibodzi adoita kuti vave vadokwana nokusingapere vaye vanoitiwa vatsvene.<verse eid="HEB 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 10:15" />NaMweya Mutsvene anotipfakazirawo, paanoti,<verse eid="HEB 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 10:16" />“Chakarechi ndicho chibvumirano chandichaita navo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:16">mumasure momazuva yakareyo, ndizvo zvinonyaira Ishe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:16">ndichaisa mitemo yangu mumwoyo yavo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:16">nokuinyora mupfungwa dzavo,”<verse eid="HEB 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 10:17" />uye anoingidzira achiti, “Zvitema zvavo nokukanganisa kvavo ndichazviyeukaba.” <verse eid="HEB 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 10:18" />Manje kana panokurekerehwa kwozvakarezvi, hakuchinai kubaihwa kwozvitema.<verse eid="HEB 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbatiuyei Papfupi naMwari</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 10:19" />Naizvozvo hama dzangu, zvatinochivimbo chokupinda muimba itsvene nogazi raJesu, <verse eid="HEB 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 10:20" />nonzira itsva ipenyu yaadotivhurira kuburikidza nobiza rokudziirira, ndiwo muviri wache. <verse eid="HEB 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 10:21" />Sezvo tinomupirisita mukuru paimba yaMwari, <verse eid="HEB 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 10:22" />mbatinyedzei papfupi nomwoyo wochokwadi nokutenda kudosimba, nomwoyo yedu yawazihwa nokunatsiwa kubva pahana idoipa uye miviri yedu yashambidziwa nomvura idochena. <verse eid="HEB 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 10:23" />Mbatibatitsitsei kupupura kwotariro yedu kuti tireke kugwetedzeka, nokuti iye adotivimbisa adotendeka. <verse eid="HEB 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 10:24" />Mbationei kuti tamutsana mwoyo kuti tive norudo nomabasa yadonaka, <verse eid="HEB 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 10:25" />tisingareke kuungana kwedu pabodzi, setsika iri kuitiwa novamwe, asi tikurudzirane chaizvo zvamunoona kuti Zuva rakareriye riri kunyedza papfupi.<verse eid="HEB 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 10:26" />Nokuti kana tichimbondotadza utova mumasure mokunge tatambira ruzivo pamusoro pochokwadi, hakuchinai chimwe chibairo pamusoro pozvitema, <verse eid="HEB 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 10:27" />asi kundomirira tichicha kutongewa, nokutsamwa kunopfuta kunge moto kuchapedza vavengi vaMwari. <verse eid="HEB 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 10:28" />Munhu wese waichora mutemo waMozisi waipfa asinganzvihwe mutsa kana paita pfakazi dziiri kana dzitatu. <verse eid="HEB 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="HEB 10:29" />Munofunga kuti murango udoipitsitsa tiniko uchapasiwa munhu anoramba Mwanakomana waMwari, uye anoti gazi rochibvumirano raadoitiwa mutsvene naro, harinai nokabonyo kese achizvidza Mweya wonyasha? <verse eid="HEB 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="HEB 10:30" />Nokuti tinomuziva iye adoti, “Kutsiva mhwangu, ndicharipira.” Pakamu, “Ishe achatonga vanhu vache.” <verse eid="HEB 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="HEB 10:31" />Chinhu chinochisa kuwira mumanja yaMwari mupenyu.<verse eid="HEB 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="HEB 10:32" />Asi yeukai mazuva yokuthanga mumasure mokuvhenekehwa, mudotsungirira pakuhwa kukuru nomatambudziko, <verse eid="HEB 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="HEB 10:33" />dzimwe nguwa hamunai kubatiwa zvidonaka muchitambudziwa pamberi povanhu, dzimwe nguwa mudokovana novamwe vaiitihwa zvakarezvo. <verse eid="HEB 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="HEB 10:34" />Nokuti mudonzvira tsitsi vasungwa, mudotambira norufaro kuti zvidziyo zvenyu zvipambiwe, sezvo manga muchiziva kuti imipa pachenyu munopfuma idonaka uye inogara. <verse eid="HEB 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="HEB 10:35" />Nokudaro rekai kutaya chivimbo chenyu chinomubairo mukuru. <verse eid="HEB 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="HEB 10:36" />Nokuti munofanira kuva nokutsungirira kuitira kuti mumasure mokuita kuda kwaMwari mupasiwe chipikihwa. <verse eid="HEB 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="HEB 10:37" />Nokuti</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:37">“Kwandosara kanguwa kapfupipfupi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:37">Iye anouya achauya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:37">asingachehwe,<verse eid="HEB 10:37" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="HEB 10:38" />asi adorurama wangu achararama nokutenda,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:38">manje kana akadzokera mumasure,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:38">mweya wangu haufari naye.”<verse eid="HEB 10:38" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="HEB 10:39" />Asi hatisi avo vokudzokera kumasure kuti tiparadziwe, asi tiri avo vakutenda kuti vaponese mweya.<verse eid="HEB 10:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="HEB 11" />
  <para style="s">Kutenda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 11:1" />Zvino kutenda ndicho chisimbiso chozvinhu zvatinotarisira, nochiratidzo chozvinhu zvatisingaone. <verse eid="HEB 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 11:2" />Nokuti naiko vanhu vokare vadopfakazihwa zvidonaka.<verse eid="HEB 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 11:3" />Nokutenda tinonzvitsitsa kuti nyika idosikiwa noshoko raMwari, nokudaro zvinooneka zvidoitiwa nozvinhu zvisingaoneke. <verse eid="HEB 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 11:4" />Nokutenda Ebhero adobaira chibairo chidonaka kuna Mwari kupinda chaKhaini, kuburikidza nacho adopfakazihwa kuti wanga adorurama, Mwari achimupfakazira nokufarira zvipo zvache, adopfa, asi kuburikidza nokutenda kwache achiri kunyaira nanasi.<verse eid="HEB 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 11:5" />Nokutenda Inoki adotorewa kuti areke kuona ipfa, uye haanai kudzooneka, nokuti Mwari wanga wamutora. Nokuti asati watorewa adopfakazihwa kuti wanga achifadza Mwari. <verse eid="HEB 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 11:6" />Uye kana pasinai kutenda hazvikwanisike kumufadza. Nokuti wese anonyedza papfupi naMwari anofanira kutenda kuti iye aripo uye kuti anopasa mibairo vakarevo vanomutsvagitsitsa.<verse eid="HEB 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 11:7" />Nokutenda Nowa, paadochenjedzewa pamusoro pozvinhu zvanga zvisinati zvaoneka, adoteerera ndokugadzira ngarava kuti araramise mhuri yache, nozvakarezvi adopasa nyika mhosva akava mugari wonhaka yokururama kunouya nokutenda.<verse eid="HEB 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 11:8" />Nokutenda Abhurahamu adoteerera paadodaidziwa kuti aende kunzvimbo yaadoudziwa kuti waidzoipasiwa ichiva nhaka yache, adobirika ndokuenda asingazive kwaanga achienda. <verse eid="HEB 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 11:9" />Nokutenda adogara munyika yochipikihwa kunge mutohwa, sepanyika yovamwe, adogara mumatumba naIsaki naJakobho, vanga vari vaji vonhaka yochipikihwa chibodzicho pabodzi naye. <verse eid="HEB 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 11:10" />Nokuti wanga achigurupira kuwana guta ranga rinonheyo, munhadziri nomuvakhi warene ari Mwari.<verse eid="HEB 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 11:11" />Nokutenda naiye Sara pachake adopasiwa masimba yokuita pamuviri kana zvache wanga wachemberetsa asinati wazvara, nokuti adoti iyeyo adomupikira adotendeka. <verse eid="HEB 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 11:12" />Naizvozvo kubva kumurume mubodzi, wanga watoita kunge adopfa, kudozvahwa vana vadowanda kunge nyenyedzi dzokudzuru uye kunge jecha riri kumhera kwogungwa risingaverengeke.<verse eid="HEB 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 11:13" />Vanhu vakareva vese vadopfa vachitenda, vasinai kupasiwa zvavadovimbisiwa, asi vadozviona zviri kurefu ndokuzvitambira, uye vadotenda kuti ivo mbarendo novatohwa panyika. <verse eid="HEB 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 11:14" />Nokuti vanhu vanonyaira zvidodarozvo vanonangidza pachenu kuti vari kutsvaga nyika yavo chaiyo. <verse eid="HEB 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 11:15" />Nokuti kana dai vairamba vachifunga pamusoro ponyika yakareyo yavadobva kwairi, vangadai vadowana mukana wokudzoka. <verse eid="HEB 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 11:16" />Asi manje vanoda imwe nyika idonaka, iyo yokudenga. Naizvozvo Mwari haanai nyadzi kuti adaidziwe kuti Mwari wavo, nokuti adovagadzirira guta.<verse eid="HEB 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 11:17" />Nokutenda Abhurahamu, paadoedzewa naMwari, adopereka Isaki sechibairo, iye wanga watambira zvivimbiso wanga waakuda kubaira mwanakomana wache mubodzi basi, <verse eid="HEB 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 11:18" />kana zvazvene Mwari wanga wati kwaari, “Nghuburikidza naIsaki kuti vana vako vadaidziwe zita.” <verse eid="HEB 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 11:19" />Abhurahamu adoona kuti Mwari anokona kumutsa vanhu kuvadopfa, naipopawo kana tichinyaira nomufananidzo, adomugamuchira pakamu kubva kuvadopfa.<verse eid="HEB 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 11:20" />Nokutenda Isaki adokomborera umwe noumwe wovanakomana vaJakobho naIsau pamusoro poramangwana ravo.<verse eid="HEB 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 11:21" />Nokutenda Jakobho, paanga wakupfa, adokomborera mwanakomana umwe noumwe waJosefa, adonamata adokotamira pamusoro potsvimbo yache.<verse eid="HEB 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 11:22" />Nokutenda Josefa, paanga waakusvika kumagumo kwoupenyu hwache, adonyaira zvokubirika kwovana vaIzirairi, adovatsindikira pamusoro pokuvikhiwa kwomapfupa yache.<verse eid="HEB 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 11:23" />Nokutenda Mozisi, paadozvahwa adosvisviwa novabereki vache kwomwedzi mitatu, nokuti vadoona kuti wanga ari mwana adonaka, havanai kucha mutemo wamambo.<verse eid="HEB 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 11:24" />Nokutenda Mozisi, wakura, adoramba kunzi mwanakomana womwanasikana waFarao, <verse eid="HEB 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 11:25" />adosarudza kuitihwa zvidoipa pabodzi novanhu vaMwari panomafaro yozvitema yonguwa ipfupipfupi. <verse eid="HEB 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 11:26" />Iye adoti kubatiwa uyanga nokuda kwaKhirisitu ipfuma ikuru panoupfumi hwese hwoIjipiti, nokuti adonangara kumubairo.<verse eid="HEB 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 11:27" />Nokutenda adobirika muIjipiti asingache ukari hwamambo, nokuti adotsungirira semunhu anoona iye asingaoneke. <verse eid="HEB 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 11:28" />Nokutenda adochengeta Phasika nokuwazira gazi, kuti Mubai womatangwe areke kubata matangwe yovaIzirairi.<verse eid="HEB 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="HEB 11:29" />Nokutenda vanhu vadoyambuka Gungwa Ritsvuku sepanyika idooma, asi vaIjipiti, pavadoedza zvibodzi bodzizvo vadomwira nhondwa ndokupfa.<verse eid="HEB 11:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="HEB 11:30" />Nokutenda madziro yoJeriko yadowira pasi mumasure mokuzvengerehwa kwomazuva manomwe. <verse eid="HEB 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="HEB 11:31" />Nokutenda Rahabhi waiva pfambi, haanai kuparara pabodzi novaye vanga vasingateerere, nokuti wanga agamuchira nhumwa zvidonaka.<verse eid="HEB 11:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="HEB 11:32" />Uye nzvipi zvimwe zvandichanyaira? Nokuti ndichaperehwa nonguwa kuti ndinyaire zvaGidhiyoni, naBharaki, naSamusoni, naJefuta, nozvaDhavhiti naSamueri novaporofiti, <verse eid="HEB 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="HEB 11:33" />kuburikidza nokutenda ivova vadokunda umambo, vadoita zvidorurama, vadopasiwa zvipikihwa, vadovhara miromo yomhondoro, <verse eid="HEB 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="HEB 11:34" />vadodzimwa marimi yomoto waipfuta zvokupenga, vadopunyuka bakatwa ridopinza, vadosimbisiwa pakuvhuwa vakava nosimba pakuhwa, vadodzingidza mauto yomamwe marudzi. <verse eid="HEB 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="HEB 11:35" />Vakadzi vadopasiwa vadopfa vavo vamutsiwa kubva kuvadopfa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="HEB 11:35">Vamwe vadohwadzisiwa, vachiramba kusununguhwa, kuti vadzomuka pakamu kuupenyu hudonaka. <verse eid="HEB 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="HEB 11:36" />Vamwewo pakare vadotambudziwa vachisekewa nokurohwa zvikuru, uye vadotosungiwa nokuisiwa mumatorongo. <verse eid="HEB 11:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="HEB 11:37" />Vadotemewa nomabhwe, vadogwatiwa nopakati, vadobaiwa nobakatwa, vadofambafamba vadosimidziwa matehwe yomahwai noyombudzi, vasinai chinhu, vachitambudziwa, vachiitihwa zvidoipa, <verse eid="HEB 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="HEB 11:38" />kwavari nyika yanga isinai kuvafanira, vachidzungaira mugwenga nomumakomo, nomumapako nomumakomba yonyika.<verse eid="HEB 11:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="HEB 11:39" />Vakareva vese vanokutenda kudopembedzewa asi haanai adotambira zvavadovimbisiwa, <verse eid="HEB 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="HEB 11:40" />nokuti Mwari wanga waona chimwe chinhu chiri nani kwatiri, kuti kana tava pabodzi navo chete, ndipo pavanoitiwa vadokwana.<verse eid="HEB 11:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="HEB 12" />
  <para style="s">Mwari Baba Vedu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 12:1" />Naizvozvo, zvatidokomberedzewa noguti rovapfakazi ridokura daipa, mbatibiritsei zvese zvinotiremera, nozvitadzo zvinombondotinamatira, timhanye nokutsungirira mujaho watidotarihwa, <verse eid="HEB 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 12:2" />tidonangara kunaJesu muvambi nomukwanisi wokutenda kwedu, iye adoshinga pamuchinjikwa nokuda kwomufaro udoisiwa pamberi pache, adoshora kunyadzisiwa kwawene, achibva wagarikika kujanja roruji romupando woushe hwaMwari.<verse eid="HEB 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 12:3" />Mucherechedzei wakareyu adoshingirira pakupikisa kwovatadzi, kuitira kuti imipa mureke kuneta kana kuwa chikhomo. <verse eid="HEB 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 12:4" />Mukukikiritsana kwenyu nozvitadzo hamunati madzivisa kusvikira pakubirika gazi. <verse eid="HEB 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 12:5" />Anga makangamwa nai kutsindikira kunonyaira kwamuri sekuvana kuchiti?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 12:5">“Mwana wangu, reka kuzvidza kuranga kwaIshe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 12:5">reka kupera mwoyo kana uchirangiwa naye.<verse eid="HEB 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 12:6" />Nokuti Ishe anoranga waanoda,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 12:6">nokurova mwana wese waanogamuchira.”<verse eid="HEB 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 12:7" />Munofanira kutsunga pakurangiwa. Mwari ari kukubatai sevana vache, nokuti ngupi mwana asingarangiwe nababa vache? <verse eid="HEB 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 12:8" />Kana mukareka kurangiwa, sezvinoitiwa vana vese, muri vana vomasanganiswa hamuzi vana vache. <verse eid="HEB 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 12:9" />Pamusoro pozvakarezvi, isisu taiva nanababa vedu vopanyika vaitiranga uye taivakudza. Ko hatingazviise pasi paBaba vomweya yedu kuti tirarame? <verse eid="HEB 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 12:10" />Nokuti ivo vadotiranga kwonguwa ipfupi sezvavaida, asi iye anotiranga kuti zvitinakire sezvaadoona zvidokodzera, kuti tikovehwe utsvene hwache. <verse eid="HEB 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 12:11" />Zvino kwokanguwa kuranga kwese hakufadze, asi kunodzimba pamasure kunobereka chibereko chorugare chinouyisa kururama kuno vadodzidzisiwa nako.<verse eid="HEB 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Rairo noChenjedzo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 12:12" />Saka simbisai pakamu manja yadorebhwedeka nomabvi yasinai simba, <verse eid="HEB 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 12:13" />uye nhadzirirai tsoka dzenyu nzira dzidorungama, kuti chinodzomhira chireke kudzvuguduka asi kuti chiporesewe.<verse eid="HEB 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 12:14" />Tsvagai kuva norugare novanhu vese, uye noutsvene nokuti kunze kwahwene hapanai achaona Ishe. <verse eid="HEB 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 12:15" />Onai kuti hapanai anokundikana kuwana mutsa waMwari, kuti “mudzi unovava” ureke kumuka uchikutambudzai, uye kuti nawo vazinji vasvipisiwe. <verse eid="HEB 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 12:16" />Mbakureke kuva nomhombo kana asinai basa nokunamata fanike Isau, adotengesa udangwe hwache nokundoja kabodzi basi. <verse eid="HEB 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 12:17" />Nokuti munoziva kuti mumasure mozvakarezvo, paanga waakuda kugara nhaka yokukomborehwa, adorambiwa, nokuti haanai kuwana nguwa yokupinduka, kana zvazvene adoitsvaga nomisodzi.<verse eid="HEB 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 12:18" />Nokuti hamunai kuuya kugomo rinobatika nomanja, futi riri kupfuta moto, uye kurima nokukusvipa nokuduthu rikuru, <verse eid="HEB 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 12:19" />nokukurira kwotsuri, nokuizvi romashoko ivo vadorinzva vadokumbira kuti yamwe mashoko yareke kudzonyaihwa kwavari. <verse eid="HEB 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 12:20" />Nokuti vadotadza kutsungirira pano zvavadopasiwa kuti vateedze, “Kunyange mhuka kana ikasvika pagomo, ichatakiwa nomabhwe.” <verse eid="HEB 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 12:21" />Nzvimbo yacho yanga ichichisa chaizvo, zvokuti naMozisi adototi, “Ndinotetemera nokucha.”<verse eid="HEB 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 12:22" />Asi imipa mudouya kugomo roZiyoni nokuguta raMwari mupenyu, Jerusarema rokudenga, nokungirozi dzisingaverengeke dzinounganira mhemberero, <verse eid="HEB 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 12:23" />nokuungano yomatangwe yadonyorewa kudenga, nokumutongi anova Mwari wovese, nokumweya yovadorurama vadokwanisiwa, <verse eid="HEB 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 12:24" />nokunaJesu, murevereri wochibvumirano chitsva, nokugazi ridosasiwa rinonyaira zvidonaka kupinda raEbhero.<verse eid="HEB 12:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 12:25" />Onai kuti munorambaba iye ari kunyaira. Nokuti kana ivo vadomuramba vasinai kupukunyuka paanga achivachenjedza panyika, kana naisisuwo tinopukunyukaba kana tikamuramba iye anotichenjedza kubva kudenga. <verse eid="HEB 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 12:26" />Izvi rache pakarepo ridogwetedza nyika, asi iye zvino adovimbisa, achiti, “Ndichagwetedza pakamu kabodzi aikona nyika basi asi nodengawo.” <verse eid="HEB 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 12:27" />Manje shoko iri rokuti, “Kabodzi pakamu,” rinonangidza kubiritsiwa kwozvinogwetedzeka, zviri zvidosikiwa, kuitira kuti zvisingagwetedzeke zvisare.<verse eid="HEB 12:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 12:28" />Sezvo tiri kutambira umambo husingagwetedzeke mbatitendei nokushumira Mwari kunotambirika nokuremekedza nokucha, <verse eid="HEB 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="HEB 12:29" />nokuti Mwari wedu moto unoparadza.<verse eid="HEB 12:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="HEB 13" />
  <para style="s">Mafadziro Yatingaite Mwari</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 13:1" />Rudo mbarirambe riripo pakati pohama. <verse eid="HEB 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 13:2" />Damba kureka kuitira varendo rudo, nokuti vachidaro vamwe vadogara pabodzi nongirozi vasingazvizive. <verse eid="HEB 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 13:3" />Yeukai avo vari mutorongo, kunge mudosungiwa pabodzi navo, novanobatiwa uyanga, sekunge ndimi muri kutambura.<verse eid="HEB 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 13:4" />Kuroorana mbakukudziwe nomunhu wese, nobonde rovadoroorana mbarireke kusvipisiwa, nokuti Mwari achatongesa mhombo nomahure.<verse eid="HEB 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 13:5" />Zvichengetei mudosununguka kubva pakuditsa mari, uye mugutsikane nozvamunazvo, nokuti iye adoti, “Ndinokurekeraba kana kukusiya.” <verse eid="HEB 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 13:6" />Nokudaro tinonyaira tisingache tichiti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 13:6">“Ishe ndiye mubatsiri wangu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 13:6">Ndinochaba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 13:6">munhu anondiiteiko?”<verse eid="HEB 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 13:7" />Yeukai vatungamiriri venyu, vakarevo vadokuparidzirai shoko raMwari; cherechedzai kuguma kwoupenyu hwavo, motevera kutenda kwavo. <verse eid="HEB 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 13:8" />Jesu Khirisitu anogara adodaro nezuro, nasi nokusingapere. <verse eid="HEB 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 13:9" />Rekai kutsambutsiwa nodzimwe dzidziso dzisingazikane, nokuti zvidonaka kuti mwoyo usimbisiwe nomutsa, aikona nozvokuja zvidoyeresewa, zvisinai kubatsira ivo vanozvija.<verse eid="HEB 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 13:10" />Isisu tino atari pasingatendehwe kujihwa novanobata basa pabumba rokukumanira. <verse eid="HEB 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 13:11" />Nokuti zvitunha zvozvipfuwo zvinogazi raiuyisiwa muimba itsvene nomuphirisita mukuru sechipiriso chozvitema zvaipisihwa kunze kwomusasa. <verse eid="HEB 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 13:12" />Saka naJesuwo adotambudzika kunze kwomusuwo weguta kuti aita vanhu vatsvene kuburikidza nogazi rache. <verse eid="HEB 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 13:13" />Naizvozvo mbatibudire kwaari kunze kwomusasa, titakure kunyadzisiwa kwaadokumana nako. <verse eid="HEB 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 13:14" />Nokuti pano hatinai guta rinogara, asi tinotsvaga guta richadzouya. <verse eid="HEB 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 13:15" />Naizvozvo mbatirambei tichimbondobaira chibairo chokurumbidza Mwari kuburikidza naye, ndicho chibereko chomiromo inopfakaza zita rache. <verse eid="HEB 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 13:16" />Rekai kukangamwa kuita zvidonaka nokukovana novamwe zvamunazvo, ndava Mwari anofadziwa nokuzvipira kudodaro.<verse eid="HEB 13:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 13:17" />Tetekerai vatungamiriri venyu muzviise pasi pavo, nokuti vanochengeta mweya yenyu, sevanhu vachadzobvunziwa pamusoro penyu. Itai zvakarezvi kuti ivo vaitewo basa ravo vachifara vasingaremehwe, ndava zvakarezvo hazvikubatsirei chinhu.<verse eid="HEB 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 13:18" />Tinamatirei, nokuti tinochokwadi kuti tinohana dzidochena tinoda kuita zvidonaka muzvinhu zvese. <verse eid="HEB 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 13:19" />Ndinokukumbiritsai kuti muite zvakarezvi kuitira kuti ndidzotsehwe kwamuri nokamangu.<verse eid="HEB 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Munamato Wokuvhara</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 13:20" />Zvino Mwari worugare adodzotsa pakare kubva kuvadopfa Ishe wedu Jesu, nyakabusa mukuru womahwai, nogazi rochibvumirano chisingapere, <verse eid="HEB 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 13:21" />mbaakukwanisei nozvinhu zvese zvidonaka kuti muite kuda kwache, iye achishanda mukati menyu zvinhu zvinofadza pamberi pache, kuburikidza naJesu Khirisitu, mbaave nokubhwinya nokusingaperepere! Ameni.<verse eid="HEB 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mazvi yokuPedzisira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 13:22" />Ndapota hama dzangu, batiranai pashoko rokuraira kwangu, nokuti ndidokunyorerai zvishomashoma. <verse eid="HEB 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 13:23" />Nzvitsitsai kuti hama yedu Timoti adosununguhwa. Kana akakurumidza kusvika ndichauya kudzokuonai pabodzi naye.<verse eid="HEB 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 13:24" />Ndimoreserei vatungamiriri venyu vese novatsvene vese. Avo vanobva kuItari vanokumoresai.<verse eid="HEB 13:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 13:25" />Mutsa mbauve nemi mese. Ameni.<verse eid="HEB 13:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 13" />
</usx>